%% App boot sequence (lib/main.dart + NavigationLogicMixin). Boot rules: AGENTS.md rule 6.
sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as main.dart
    participant Env as PrjEnv / CcSdkConfig
    participant Boot as Parallel boot
    participant Bridge as AppLifecycleProvider (modules/bridge)
    participant Router as auto_route (AppRouter)
    participant Shell as MainNavigation + NavigationLogicMixin

    Main->>Env: await initEnv()
    Main->>Boot: await Future.wait([Firebase, DI, Hive, Localization])
    Boot-->>Main: ready
    Main-)Bridge: uploadPendingCrashLogs() (not awaited)
    Main-)Main: CcAppAttestation.activate() (not awaited)
    Main->>Router: Catcher2 runs AppRunner (MaterialApp.router)
    Router->>Shell: initial route: MainNavigation
    Shell->>Shell: SplashManager.shouldShowSplash()
    alt first launch
        Shell->>Shell: show Splash, then the main tabs
    else
        Shell->>Shell: show the main tabs
    end
    Note over Shell: AUTO_ROUTE_START set to the quick-test route adds a quick-test second tab
    Shell-)Bridge: initializeUserLevel() (not awaited)
    Shell-)Shell: after first frame: AppUpdatePrompter.checkAndPrompt()
    Shell-)Shell: after ~3 s: analytics, performance, background services
